OL,3,ANvidia says it won't reinstate Huang as
OL,4,Afirm reports bumper results
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia's quarterly sales doubled to top
OL,7,F$100bn for the first time as the
OL,8,Fcompany insisted it has no plans to
OL,9,Freinstate ousted co-founder Jensen
OL,10,FHuang.
OL,12,FIn the company's first results since
OL,13,FHuang's dramatic exit, interim chief
OL,14,Fexecutive Colette Kress said it is
OL,15,F"business as usual" and told investors:
OL,16,F"We've got this."
OL,18,FThe company's quarterly sales doubled
OL,19,Ffrom a year earlier, reaching $115.8bn
OL,20,F(#86.9bn), with shares in the company
OL,21,Fjumping by 4.8% in after-hours trading.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
